1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,007
Hello everyone and welcome back to the channel. Today we're diving into a powerful learning method known as the Feynman Technique.

2
00:00:00,007 --> 00:00:00,013
This approach, popularized by the Nobel Prize-winning physicist Richard Feynman, is all about understanding, not just memorizing.

3
00:00:00,013 --> 00:00:00,020
It involves four simple steps: choose a concept, teach it to a toddler, identify gaps, and then simplify and organize.

4
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:00,027
By trying to explain a complex topic in simple terms, you quickly expose what you truly understand and what you don't.

5
00:00:00,027 --> 00:00:00,031
It's an incredibly effective way to deepen your knowledge and master any subject.
